DOAO6SJc8AAAABDjMrNA","user":{"login":"MockingSpark","id":27427497,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI3NDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27427497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark","html_url":"https://github.com/MockingSpark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T09:35:23Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T09:35:23Z","body":"Yes sorry, I changed it","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4533201716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4537615514","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119714#issuecomment-4537615514","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119714","id":4537615514,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDnaEmg","user":{"login":"Cyklon3000","id":67823272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODIzMjcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67823272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000","html_url":"https://github.com/Cyklon3000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T22:18:14Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T22:18:14Z","body":"Currently investigating, here a few findings: \nApparently when the `Navmesh` is obstructed by an collider they consistently generate at a fixed height, regardless of the `StaticBody3D` height.\n<img width=\"2450\" height=\"835\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0e66577-ade9-4415-b085-da3ea9ee6f22\" />\nAdditionally, the height offset of the `Navmesh` is not linked to the `StaticBody3D`'s height in an easily understandable manner, but jumps around wildly with varying heights, suggesting a deeper issue with whatever algorithm is used to generate the `Navmesh`.\nThough experimentation i also found out that the height of the `Navmesh` is also influenced by `NavigationMesh.cell_height`, again behaving weirdly with different sizes of the `StaticBody` beneath (but generally pushing the navmesh up), but consistent when partially blocked by other collision objects.\nIll be having a look at the implementation of `bake_navigation_mesh()`... But modifying anything in there is always dangerous, as changes in an algorithm like this often has unintended side effects.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4537615514/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4674888543","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119714#issuecomment-4674888543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119714","id":4674888543,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFqUjXw","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T21:47:18Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T21:47:18Z","body":"ReCast bakes everything based on a voxel grid that is defined by the cell size and height. The geometry input gets rasterized into that voxel grid. After that the input geometry itself becomes irrelevant. The amount of detail you can get out of the baked navmesh depends more or less entirely on that voxel grid resolution. It will still be coarse and never perfect to the original geometry because that resolution detail can not exist in the grid, at least not when you don't want to crash from creating a bazillion voxels.\n\nThat \"jumping\" you are seeing and experiencing here is the result of how those coarse voxel cells not only get created but also later interpreted. Your result changes when you add other geometry that is higher or lower as that makes the entire voxel grid change its bake volume and adds different span layouts.\n\nIf you want a somehow predictable \"stable\" result you need to use the baking bounds as that causes the baking to always use the same volume instead of whatever dynamic size might be the result of the bounds of all the currently used objects.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4674888543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5230468514","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119714#issuecomment-5230468514","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119714","id":5230468514,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN8Kdog","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-09T07:57:47Z","updated_at":"2026-08-09T07:57:47Z","body":"Closing. See description above why this is happening.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5230468514/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]